 kit bots - lists, adopts, and forgets the bots that act for you

   one of
   *kit bots*             lists, adopts, and forgets the bots that act for you

     --text   --json   --jq
                           prints the bots as text, even on a terminal

   --add                adopts the App that <name> is the slug of, with --app and --key
   --remove             forgets a bot and deletes its key
   --check              compares the App's permissions with its jobs and its installation with this
                        repository
   --bot token --json
   --bot run <command>


 kit bots
